==Trivia==
*Kinjirou Cat directly references [[:wikipedia:Ninomiya Sontoku|Ninomiya Kinjirō]], a historical philosopher known for his work in agriculture and education. He is credited for improving the lives of people in feudal Japan by promoting education and hard work to overcome adversity, as he did when he was growing up, and by innovating the agricultural knowledge and techniques of the time.

